  `â_k = Σ_j a_j ω^{jk}`, `ω² + ω + 1 = 0` — that is `Q = 1/3 + (2/3)ρ²`, `ρ² = â₁â₂/â₀²` (`koide_parseval`); and
  `Q = 2/3 ⟺ ρ² = 1/2` (`koide_two_thirds`).

* **27-fields (16 October 2026).** The electroweak counts (`weinberg_angle`, `unification_counts`, `five_eighths`), the
